{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乳、酪、蘇、糞、尿相和，澄、嚧漉服之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "令蹲踞坐嚼，面東或北，向外不成就、\n向內成就。若遠却夾久，成就東方、上、西、中、南、下，四方多是彼部"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五色線五佛加持，貫攝萬行，令住等持臂，歷\n經僧祇令不失壞，故名金剛結"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以真言及不動尊真言加持一百八遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛鉤真言引入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
